From e27a98391fdca3b694f210d7751313050197f08e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SkillBuddy Agent <agent@skillbuddy.local>
Date: Tue, 21 Jul 2026 21:21:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Phase 2 (part 2): Hardcoded data audit, logo fix, loaders,
 chat keyboard fix, back-button consistency, full Profile build
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Task 1 — Hardcoded greeting audit:
- Home already used CURRENT_USER.name correctly; Profile was pulling the
  name from a separate AuthContext user object instead. Unified both
  screens onto the single CURRENT_USER mock identity so a name change
  in one place reflects everywhere.

Task 2 — Logo size/asset fix:
- Profile screen was rendering LogoMark, a hand-traced SVG recreation,
  instead of the real logo asset. Replaced with LogoImage (same
  component Home uses) at the same 40px height for true consistency.

Task 3 — App-wide loaders:
- Added InlineLoader (small rotating logo mark) to complement the
  existing full-screen BrandedLoader (breathing pulse), giving the
  two-tier loading pattern the spec called for.
- Wired into Post a Job submit and Submit/Modify Bid — both now show
  the branded inline loader and disable double-taps during the async
  mock submission.

Task 4 — Chat keyboard fix:
- Root cause: KeyboardAvoidingView's behavior prop was literally
  'undefined' on Android, so there was no keyboard avoidance at all
  on that platform. Switched to react-native-keyboard-controller's
  KeyboardAvoidingView (already a project dependency, used elsewhere),
  which handles both platforms correctly with behavior='padding'.
- Applied the same fix to the new Support chat screen.

Task 5 — Back button consistency:
- New shared BackButton component (circular, theme-surface color,
  subtle shadow, ChevronLeft icon per spec).
- Applied across category/[id], search, booking/[id], profile/edit,
  chat/[id], and the three Jobs-phase screens, replacing bare icons
  and one-off inline styles.

Task 6 — Full Profile build (Modules 1C/1D):
- Extended CURRENT_USER mock with username, personal code, address,
  phone, job/payment stats, verification statuses, skills, masked
  card/IBAN; added CREDIT_HISTORY and PROVIDER_JOB_HISTORY mock data.
- Rebuilt Profile tab: Client/Provider toggle (using RoleContext),
  role-aware stat row, sectioned menu with real destinations.
- New screens: Credit Points (balance + redemption history), Documents
  (face verification + residence permit status w/ reupload), Wallet
  (role-aware spending/earnings, masked payment details), Professional
  Info (role-aware — client stats vs. provider skills/performance/job
  history, reusing the scoring engine from the Jobs phase), Settings
  (theme/notifications/language/change password), Safety & Help (SOS +
  legal links), Legal (About/Privacy/Terms), FAQs (search + category
  tabs + expandable Q&A), and a visually-distinguished Support chat
  variant with an issue-category picker.

Full workspace typecheck: zero errors across all 9 projects.
